    "title": "To‘garakka yozilish",
    "language": "html",
    "description": "method=\"get\" forma: ism (text, required), pochta (email, required), boshlanish sanasi (date), ikkita checkbox, bitta name li ikkita radio guruhi, input type=\"submit\" tugmasi. Har bir maydonda label for = id, name; checkbox va radio da - value. <button> siz.",
    "starter_code": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"uz\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>To‘garakka yozilish</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <main>\n        <h1>To‘garakka yozilish</h1>\n        <form method=\"get\">\n            <!-- Ism (text, required) -->\n            <!-- Pochta (email, required) -->\n            <!-- Boshlanish sanasi (date) -->\n            <!-- Ikkita checkbox: mavzular -->\n            <!-- Ikkita radio: vaqt (bitta name) -->\n            <!-- input type=\"submit\" -->\n        </form>\n    </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
